Fluister Demo
=============

On-device live transcription for Afrikaans and South African English.
This app is a proof of concept for the Core ML / Metal conversion of Fluister-turbo.

1. Fluister-turbo model — DigiPhyte (Pty) Ltd
---------------------------------------------
   https://huggingface.co/digiphyte/fluister-turbo-transformers
   MIT License. See LICENSE in the model folder and this repository.
   Fluister is a South African Whisper: Afrikaans, SA English, and everyday
   Afrikaans/English code-switching. Credit DigiPhyte if you ship this model.

2. Base model — OpenAI Whisper large-v3-turbo
---------------------------------------------
   https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo
   Apache License 2.0. A copy is LICENSE-whisper-apache-2.0.txt.

3. Training data (upstream of the model)
----------------------------------------
   andreoosthuizen/afrikaans-30s, CC BY 4.0
   NCHLT Speech Corpus Afrikaans and English (SADiLaR / NCHLT), CC BY 3.0

4. Inference — WhisperKit by Argmax, Inc.
-----------------------------------------
   https://github.com/argmaxinc/WhisperKit
   MIT License. Core ML conversion via whisperkittools.

This app does not send audio or transcripts off the device.
